                                    <description>The channel timer does not stop after timeout.</description>
                                    <value>#0</value>
                                </enumeratedValue>
                                <enumeratedValue>
                                    <name>1</name>
                                    <description>The channel timer will stop after a timeout, and the channel timer will restart based on TMRDCTRL. When TMRDCTRL = 0, the channel timer will restart after a rising edge on the T_EN bit is detected (which means that the timer channel is disabled and then enabled); when TMRDCTRL = 1, the channel timer will restart after a rising edge on the selected trigger is detected.</description>
